      "fix": "Read the existing slash_command contextCompression metadata and describe progress, done or noop; show paired finite supplied counts and estimation flags. Preserve existing body/detail rendering. Unknown or malformed values remain in original details.",
      "controlledResult": "历史描述不赋活动权；说明不会改变未知请求、暂停队列或独立整理活动。无需整理与整理成功明确区分，不计算节省。",
